    <string name="aa_direct_dhu_off_caption">For testing on a computer instead of a car. Tap to turn on, then on the computer: adb forward tcp:5277 tcp:5277 and run desktop-head-unit.</string>
    <string name="aa_direct_dhu_on_caption">Waiting on port 5277. On the computer: adb forward tcp:5277 tcp:5277, then run desktop-head-unit. Tap to turn off.</string>
